(text "BUCK - MAX17761  |  Analog Devices (Maxim)  |  4.5-76V 1A synchronous buck, TDFN-12 3x3" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 14.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a8bb0abc-8552-4167-91f7-ebc780384801"))
(text "Default build: VOUT = 3.3 V (fixed resistor divider - no trimmer). Other outputs: change only R_top/R_bot (and L where shown) per the VOUT table." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 19.30 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f45277a1-58f3-4f89-91ee-9a3f0af94e4f"))
(text "DESIGN EQUATIONS - MAX17761 (Analog/Maxim 19-8608 Rev 1, Applications Information)\nDesign point: VIN 24 V nom (6-75 V), VOUT 3.3 V, IOUT 1.0 A, fSW 400 kHz, PFM, 1.6 A peak limit\nOutput voltage:  R4 = 15*VOUT/0.8 = 61.9k -> 61.9k (E96 pair for min error) ;  R5 = R4*0.8/(VOUT-0.8) -> 20k\n  VOUT = 0.8*(1+R4/R5) = 3.276 V   (datasheet Fig.5 uses 57.6k/18.2k = 3.332 V)\nSwitching freq:  RT/SYNC = 105k -> 400 kHz (EC table: 210k=200k, 140k=300k, 105k=400k, 69.8k=600k)\nMODE/ILIM:  open -> PFM, ILIM_P = 1.6 A (Table 1: 422k PFM 1.14A, 243k PWM 1.6A, 121k PWM 1.14A)\nInductor:  L = 2.6*VOUT/fSW = 21.4 uH -> 22 uH XAL5050-223ME (ISAT > 1.6 A peak limit)\nOutput cap:  fC = min(15kHz, fSW/20) = 15 kHz ; tRESP = 0.33/fC = 22.0 us\n  COUT >= 0.5*ISTEP*tRESP/dVOUT = 0.5*0.25A*22.0us/99mV = 27.8 uF  -> 47uF/10V X7R 1210 (~30uF eff)\nCompensation (R6-C6 across R5):  k = fC*COUT*(1+R4/R5)/3.6274e6 = 0.508\n  R6 = (R4||R5)*k/(1-0.99k) = 15.4k ;  C6 = 1.125e6/(fC*k/(1-k^2)*R6) = 6.8n  (Fig.5: 15.4k / 6.8nF)\nSoft-start:  CSS >= 30e-6*CSEL*VOUT ; tSS = CSS/6.25uA = 3.5 ms with 22 nF (house-common value; min CSS = 30e-6*47*3.3 = 4.7 nF)\nEN/UVLO:  R1 = 3.32M, R2 = 1.215*R1/(VINU-1.215+2.5uA*R1) = 309k for VINU = 6.0 V\nVCC: 1uF to SGND. EXTVCC: tied to SGND (VOUT 3.3 V < EXTVCC switchover). RESET: 10k pull-up to VOUT.\nGENERIC CHECKS @ VIN=24V nom / 75V max, VOUT=3.3V, IOUT=1A, fSW=400kHz\n  D = VOUT/VIN = 0.137\n  dIL = VOUT(1-VOUT/VIN)/(L*fSW): 0.32A @nom, 0.36A @max  (36% of IOUT)\n  IL_PK = IOUT + dIL/2 = 1.18A ; inductor ISAT must exceed 1.6A (peak current limit)  (XAL5050-223: ISAT 3.5A)\n  ICIN_RMS = IOUT*sqrt(D(1-D)) = 0.34A (max IOUT/2 = 0.50A at D=0.5)\n  dVIN = IOUT*D(1-D)/(fSW*CIN) = 185mV with CIN_eff=1.6uF\n  dVOUT_ripple = dIL/(8*fSW*COUT) = 3.4mV with COUT_eff=30uF (ESR excluded)\n  tON @VINmax = VOUT/(VIN*fSW) = 110ns vs tON_MIN(max)=110ns -> pulse skipping possible near VINmax\n  Max VIN without pulse skipping = VOUT/(tON_MIN*fSW) = 75.0V\n  Min VIN (dropout) ~ (VOUT+IOUT*R)/(1-fSW*tOFF_MIN) = 3.67V\nIC THERMAL @ VIN nom, full load (datasheet Power Dissipation / thermal sections)\n  Pcond=IL_RMS^2*1.4*(D*RDS_HS+(1-D)*RDS_LS)=0.51W, Psw=0.5*VIN*IOUT*tsw*fSW=0.10W (tsw~20ns), Pq=0.07W\n  RDS_HS=900mOhm, RDS_LS=275mOhm typ (datasheet EC table)\n  PIC = 0.68W ; thetaJA = 41 C/W (JEDEC) -> TJ = TA + thetaJA*PIC = 53C @25C, 113C @85C ; TA(max) for TJ=125C = 97C\n  Inductor DCR loss = IOUT^2*DCR = 0.08W" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left top)) (uuid "82309437-6008-4562-8e64-f7108318ce2c"))
